<title>USA: Sunstone says to buy $200 mln in U.S. hotels.</title>
<headline>Sunstone says to buy $200 mln in U.S. hotels.</headline>
<dateline>SAN CLEMENTE, Calif. 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sunstone Hotel Investors Inc said Tuesday it plans to buy $200 million in United States hotel assets by the end of 1997.</p>
<p>The company also said it will invest $18 million in renovating its properties in 1997.</p>
</text>
